Ruwan: *(scrolling through the low stock report)* It told me the oil is low before I even noticed. Very good, child. Very good.

Amaya: And next I can add receipts, daily totals, customer points...

Nuwan: That is how every real piece of software grows. One feature at a time, tested, saved, and then the next one.

Dilshan: Can I have a copy for my tuk-tuk business?
